      <p>Dealing with fake reviews is stressful and time-consuming. While you work on removal, maintaining strong responses on all your legitimate reviews keeps your overall profile looking healthy. ReplyIQ automatically responds to every review with professional, personalized replies — so even when a fake review is dragging your rating down, your response profile shows potential customers that you are engaged, professional, and trustworthy.</p>
